  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/libstatgrab/libstatgrab/zipball/LIBSTATGRAB_0_92_2",
  "body": "This release includes a number of bugfixes and is API and ABI compatible with 0.92.1.\r\n\r\n * Fix virtual memory usage calculation in the vm_stats example.\r\n * Fix a memory leak when cleaning up user statistics.\r\n * Fix build on OmniOS.\r\n * Fix buffer overruns when reading process command lines.\r\n * Initialise process session IDs on platforms which do not provide them.\r\n * Fix buffer overruns when the number of entries decreases between statistics samples.\r\n * Fix buffer overruns when statistics grow from zero to one entry.\r\n * Fix use-after-free and double-free errors after empty or failed statistics refreshes."
